1. FINAL DECISIONS (these resolve every conflict)
=====================================================
D1 admission_no is unique across ALL sessions (among non-deleted rows). The same admission_no in an upload = UPDATE, never a second row. If it exists under a different academic session, do not overwrite: put the row in an admin "Admission No Clash" list.
D2 One person = StudentProfile; each admission = Enrollment (1 profile -> many enrollments). Same Student Name + Father Name + Mobile with a different admission_no is a VALID cross-batch enrollment, never an error or "duplicate".
D3 "Batch": the 22-field list has no Batch field. batch_name comes from the column mapped to Batch in the template (default: Course Name). Optional extra mapping "Admission Date"; if not mapped, admission-date reports use the upload date.
D4 Phones: store a normalized 10-digit number (strip spaces, symbols, +91, leading 0). Fewer than 10 digits = row imported with a warning and no auto-linking. Dial link uses a configurable prefix (default +91).
D5 Time: store UTC, display IST (Asia/Kolkata) as "02 Nov 2026, 04:30 PM". "Day" always means the IST day. Use one helper istDay(); never use server-local time.
D6 Task states: ASSIGNED (not attempted), ATTEMPTED (called but not completed), COMPLETED (disposition Connected or Wrong Number), CANCELLED. Busy / No Answer / Switched Off / Not Reachable / Callback Requested = ATTEMPTED (retry needed).
D7 Age rules are in DAYS: a task is "New" if assigned_date is within the last N IST days (admin setting pending_after_days, default 2 = 48h); older and unattempted = "Pending" with an Overdue badge. Passing due_date also marks Overdue. Assignment date may be today or earlier, never future. Status is computed on read, never by a browser timer.
D8 Each task/reminder appears in exactly ONE mentor bucket at a time (9.4). No duplicate rows anywhere.
D9 Same-day edit window = until 11:59:59 PM IST of the call's day, judged by the server clock.
D10 Monthly relationship call: a qualifying call = disposition Connected. A student is "Monthly Call Due" if (last_connected_at, else enrollment created date) is older than 30 days (setting).
D11 Attendance % = Present / (Present + Absent) x 100. Leave is shown separately (setting: exclude [default] / count as absent / count as present). A BLANK cell = "not recorded", never Absent.
D12 Results/attendance are matched by Admission No. Optional fallback: admin maps student mobile, and a row attaches ONLY if it matches EXACTLY ONE enrollment; zero or several matches go to the Unmatched/Ambiguous report. Never guess.
D13 Roles: ADMIN and MENTOR only. Mentors cannot export, upload, or see admin screens.
D14 Counts: Total Admissions (= Course Seats) = number of enrollments; Unique Students = distinct profiles; Cross-Batch Students = profiles with 2+ enrollments; Single-Course Students = profiles with exactly 1. Example: 150 students x 3 courses + 25 students x 2 courses = Unique 175, Seats 500, Cross-Batch 175. Respect the selected session, with an "All sessions" toggle.

